    <briefdescription>
<para>BBInfo - Per-basic block information used internally by <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_s_s_a_updater_impl" kindref="compound">SSAUpdaterImpl</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The predecessors of each block are cached here since <ref refid="namespacellvm_1ab5b46bfb4c91a29504b08dacfeb04a6c" kindref="member">pred_iterator</ref> is slow and we need to iterate over the blocks at least a few times. </para>
